                        "form": "хору́гвях"
                    }
                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "6b0db11f-da1e-362a-b73a-d5e348d21560",
                        "entry_id": "1ec310f7-bcde-35d2-8490-f980b9f34f94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "устар. знамя, стяг"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d3f651c0-54be-4e87-9a87-16932d45eefc",
                                "sense_id": "6b0db11f-da1e-362a-b73a-d5e348d21560",
                                "text": "Убив трёх двинских знаменоносцев, москвитяне взяли хоругвь новогородскую и к вечеру одолели врага."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "c5de9493-593c-3665-a5eb-c5ccb1c503f0",
                        "entry_id": "1ec310f7-bcde-35d2-8490-f980b9f34f94",
                        "glosses": [
                            "религ. в обиходе Православной Церкви — штандарт, полотнище на длинном шесте с изображением Иисуса Христа, Богородицы или святых, обычно выносимое во время крестных ходов"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "d7e8f637-35dd-46e0-a669-94cd3d013600",
                                "sense_id": "c5de9493-593c-3665-a5eb-c5ccb1c503f0",
                                "text": "Золотое сияние на красном фоне иконостаса, и золочёная резьба икон, и серебро паникадил и подсвечников, и плиты пола, и коврики, и хоругви вверху у клиросов, и ступеньки амвона, и старые почерневшие книги, и подрясники, и стихари — всё было залито светом."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "c0f1c439-b725-4426-878e-2d77e4372c13",
                                "sense_id": "c5de9493-593c-3665-a5eb-c5ccb1c503f0",
                                "text": "Сотни голосов разом и с мерными остановками повторяли молитвенный напев: толпа богомольцев тянулась внизу по дороге с крестами и хоругвями..."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "5a924424-9254-4955-baf1-74f9dcf19efb",
                        "source_entry_id": "1ec310f7-bcde-35d2-8490-f980b9f34f94",
                        "source_sense_description": "знамя",
                        "target_lang_word": "banner",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "banner",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e42007f4-4e25-3bfc-8e50-55f54eacf9d7",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A flag or standard used by a military commander, monarch or nation."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fdba4f24-bca2-42e9-8d14-fd701d43faae",
                                                "sense_id": "e42007f4-4e25-3bfc-8e50-55f54eacf9d7",
                                                "text": "“To hold Arrakis,” the Duke said, “one is faced with decisions that may cost one his self-respect.” He pointed out the window to the Atreides green and black banner hanging limply from a staff at the edge of the landing field. \"That honorable banner could come to mean many evil things.\""
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "c1b97438-4338-3612-97fd-9b74d2a071a5",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The military unit under such a flag or standard."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "363ac635-ad11-3da2-947f-1b0a56e79b08",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A military or administrative subdivision."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "41ef459a-300a-3fc0-8fb2-4e6eb77cf617",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Any large sign, especially when made of soft material or fabric."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "4142a473-1585-4edd-8926-878796be52a7",
                                                "sense_id": "41ef459a-300a-3fc0-8fb2-4e6eb77cf617",
                                                "text": "The mayor hung a banner across Main Street to commemorate the town's 100th anniversary."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "b64b12f4-8b3b-3958-a218-75e7a190abc5",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large piece of cloth with a slogan, motto, or emblem carried in a demonstration or other procession or suspended in some conspicuous place."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ff5810ac-b711-36d4-8ff2-a9d16f6fd862",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A cause or purpose; a campaign or movement."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "broadly",
                                            "figuratively"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dfe8dd8d-911d-4fcc-afb7-308426f51c25",
                                                "sense_id": "ff5810ac-b711-36d4-8ff2-a9d16f6fd862",
                                                "text": "They usually make their case under the banner of environmentalism."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "dcf67488-0275-3c4f-b154-853ba640db4c",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The title of a newspaper as printed on its front page; the nameplate; masthead."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": []
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "e728c75b-ce5e-36cb-9257-e0bf9cf14e27",
                                        "entry_id": "3a4bf093-6f01-3bf9-ab22-d9688ff561ff",
